      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The desire for peace when life feels relentlessly demanding is a deeply human yearning, but the thought of ending it is a powerful signal that you are suffering intensely. It is not wrong to want relief from overwhelming pain, but there are ways to find that peace without ending your life. Please, if these thoughts are becoming constant, reach out to a professional who can truly understand the depth of this exhaustion. You deserve support that goes beyond simple platitudes.",
      "source": "target",
